{"productId": "f5416315-adf2-43b8-b320-00ac0df1d0cd", "modelName": "Rolling Block Creedmoor #2", "modelDescription": "In the last decades of the 1880's the customization of long distance rifles was a very common habit among US shooters. This was done on the length of the barrel, on the shape of the handle, on the aiming devices and on the eventual installation of a shot served by a stecher. Following the same methods we have created this new version of Rolling Block to meet the needs of numerous shooters all over the world. It is characterized by a round, burnished, anti-reflective barrel and an old silver colored hilt, coin finish color frame and double set trigger. The pistol grip stock and the forend are made of checkered walnut.\n\n", "manufacturerName": "Davide Pedersoli", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "30fb470b-3fd8-47c6-bb4e-dc31c836b9f1", "description": "Davide Pedersoli, Rolling Block Creedmoor #2, 45-70 Gov, 30\" Barrel, Walnut Stock, Blued, Right Hand, 1 Round", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/06154c9d-e8fe-47e1-a78d-86b060dc4dd7"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "S822457", "upc": "8029874018012", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5ba92", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "489958cc-0acf-432b-a36b-80107a101b7e", "valueName": "Blued"}, {"attributeNameId": "5978af0e-1de2-4b6e-9b64-b8c25e2e8d70", "attributeName": "Caliber", "attributeValueId": "f9ee660f-a5c3-493c-aa90-1ed89b83b765", "valueName": "45-70 Government"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "9ceeb417-fe1e-437e-915f-6967830be35b", "valueName": "30\""}, {"attributeNameId": "7c11c5f3-970e-4119-9b86-521429f6df57", "attributeName": "Stock Type", "attributeValueId": "e282f44e-03e0-4ae2-9f93-dd5f73c65562", "valueName": "Wood"}, {"attributeNameId": "2ec4f4e1-4aed-47a2-bb02-cd7f86849836", "attributeName